502 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Experience\050\nFreelance \050selected clients\051 \050\nPleo \174 Designer \174 Feb 2026 \055 Present \174 Remote\nDesigned a new 0\2221 enterprise feature from concept through launch\054 now a core part of Pleo\047s multi\055entity spend management offering\056\050\nZalando \174 Designer  \174 Feb 2025 \055 Aug 2025 \174 Berlin\054 Hybrid\050Launched Profiles for Zalando\047s inspiration\055led discovery shift\054 adopted by 5 brand partners for commercial use\054 built to full WCAG accessibility compliance\056\050\nGrab \174 Designer \174 Aug 2023 \055 Nov 2024 \174 Singapore\054 Remote\050Led research and early concept development for future\055facing driver and food\055discovery experiences\054 developing 50\053 concepts exploring new interaction models across mobility and consumer services\056\050\nSonnen \174 Designer \174 Jan 2022 \055 May 2023 \174 Berlin\050Improved B2B web platforms for the partner ecosystem\054 enabling more efficient commissioning\054 servicing\054 and scaling of PV battery systems\056\050\nTaxfix \174 Designer \174 May 2020 \055 Jun 2021 \174 Berlin\050Designed a new product with a different value proposition for the Italian market\054 reducing filing time from 28 minutes to 7 \055 cutting completion time by 75\045\056\n\050In\055house \050\nDesignit \174 Senior UX Designer \174 2018 \055 2020 \174 Berlin\050Led multidisciplinary teams across mobility\054 finance\054 and consumer domains \055 designed a flagship watch face for Huawei\054 worked on a digital rebrand for Raiffeisen Bank across 15 countries\054 and redesigned KYC for Raiffeisen\047s corporate clients\054 cutting processing time by 50\045\056\050\nB\055Reel \174 Senior UX Designer \174 2017 \055 2018 \174 Berlin\050Designed and shipped interactive web experiences for global brands including Hublot and Google\054 translating creative concepts into high\055quality\054 production\055ready digital products\056\050\nHERE \174 Interaction Designer \174 2015 \055 2017 \174 Berlin\050Designed interaction and sound experiences for embedded automotive navigation \050Jaguar XF\051\054 widely regarded as the leading in\055car navigation system in 2016\054 and developed multiscreen\054 multimodal\054 and sound design concepts for autonomous driving scenarios\056\n\050\nServices\050\nProduct strategy \046 problem framing \055 Defining what to build and why through product vision\054 value propositions\054 MVP definition\054 and informed decision\055making\056\050\nExperience \046 interaction design \055 Designing clear\054 usable product experiences with strong attention to interaction\054 behavior\054 and multimodal systems\056\050\nDelivery\054 validation \046 collaboration \055 Hands\055on design from concept to release\054 working closely with founders and product teams through prototyping\054 testing\054 and iteration\056\n\n\nEducation\050\nMSc Media Technology \055 Aalborg University\054 Copenhagen \050DK\051\050Master\047s thesis with maximum grade \05012\05712\051\050\nBA Sound Engineering \055 Conservatorio Cesare Pollini\054 Padua \050IT\051\050Final thesis with maximum grade \050110\057110\054 with honours\051\n\n\nSkills\050\nProduct Design \267 Product Strategy \267 UX Research \267 Interaction Design \267 Prototyping \267 Design Systems \267 Sound Interaction Design \267 Multimodal Design)
     /K [ 3 ]
